msgstr "全部公開頁面與清單"

msgid "Available"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "Before the footer"
msgstr "頁尾之前"

msgid "Choose a public, password-free page and maintain its content in the block editor. Regions support static blocks and are visible to everyone on the selected page types."
msgstr "選擇公開、無密碼的頁面，在區塊編輯器中維護內容。內容區支援靜態區塊，在所選頁面類型中對所有訪客可見。"

msgid "Choose a published page without a password whose parent pages are also public."
msgstr "請選擇已發佈、無密碼的頁面，其父級頁面也必須公開且無密碼。"

msgid "Choose a source page or clear the selection."
msgstr "請選擇來源頁面，或清空選擇。"

msgid "Choose a source page."
msgstr "請選擇來源頁面。"

msgid "Choose layouts and maintain public static regions with ordinary pages."
msgstr "選擇頁首頁尾版面配置，並用普通頁面維護公開靜態內容區。"

msgid "Custom HTML anchors are not supported in content regions. Remove the block anchors and HTML id attributes from the source page."
msgstr "內容區不支援自訂 HTML 錨點。請移除來源頁面的區塊錨點及 HTML id 屬性。"

msgid "Data bindings are not supported in public content regions."
msgstr "公開內容區不支援動態資料繫結。"

msgid "Edit source page"
msgstr "編輯來源頁面"

msgid "Footer layout"
msgstr "頁尾版面配置"

