msgstr "關閉"

msgid "Posts"
msgstr "文章"

msgid "Source unavailable"
msgstr "來源不可用"

msgid "Stacked footer"
msgstr "縱向頁尾"

msgid "The source page has too many blocks. Use at most 200 blocks."
msgstr "來源頁面區塊過多，最多支援 200 個區塊。"

msgid "The source page has too many nested blocks. Use at most 16 levels."
msgstr "來源頁面巢狀過深，最多支援 16 層區塊。"

msgid "The source page is too large. Keep its saved content within 64 KiB."
msgstr "來源頁面過大，請將已儲存內容控制在 64 KiB 以內。"

msgid "The source page or one of its parents is unavailable."
msgstr "來源頁面或其父級頁面不可用。"

msgid "Two-row header"
msgstr "兩行頁首"

msgid "Use only static paragraphs, headings, lists, groups, columns, buttons, images, separators, spacers and supported Details blocks. HTML, shortcodes, reusable patterns and dynamic blocks are not supported."
msgstr "請僅使用靜態段落、標題、清單、分組、分欄、按鈕、圖片、分隔線、間隔及受支援的詳細資訊區塊。不支援 HTML、短程式碼、同步版型和動態區塊。"

msgid "Body font"
msgstr "正文字型"

msgid "Choose an installed local Font Library family. Missing files fall back to system fonts. Install and manage fonts in WordPress; the theme never downloads fonts."
msgstr "選擇字型庫中已安裝的本地字型；檔案無法使用時會改用系統字型。請在 WordPress 安裝及管理字型，佈景主題不會下載字型。"

